{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
'''Group D of the [[2002 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place between 4 and 14 June 2002. [[South Korea national football team|South Korea]] won the group, and advanced to the second round, along with the [[United States men's national soccer team|United States]]. [[Portugal national football team|Portugal]] and [[Poland national football team|Poland]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |last=Manaschev |first=Erlan |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/2002full.html |title=World Cup 2002 – Match Details |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |date=3 July 2008 |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

